WEBVTT

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:09.070
All they had left was mackerel miso.

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:10.030
I love you!

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:11.820
Please, go out with me!

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.490
I'm not feeling it at all!

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:18.000
You couldn't even become
Anna's illicit lover with that.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:18.710
Illicit?!

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:20.580
Above all else,

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:23.210
might you perhaps know
some special techniques?

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:24.050
Special techniques?!

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:27.010
Kobayakawa-san wouldn't
ask something like that!

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:28.470
You never know!

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:29.970
She just might!

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:31.470
She would not!

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:33.260
What are you doing?

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:34.680
Love confession practice.

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:36.600
I'm Tomoko!

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.430
I'm Keiko!

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.360
To me it looks like you are just goofing off.

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:46.360
Because these two are not taking it seriously!

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:48.280
But it's boring!

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:52.160
What will it take to de-borify it then?

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:53.580
Hold on.

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:55.080
Your word use there was kinda weird.

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:56.080
It felt off to me.

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:58.200
Quit being so picky!

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.290
It bugged me.

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:01.920
<i>After a romantic rival showed up
to compete with Na-chan,</i>

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:04.000
<i>I was wondering what would happen.</i>

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:06.340
So then,

00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:07.960
what do you plan to do with this practice?

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:10.800
Huh? Well... obviously, I'll...

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:12.220
c-confess...

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:13.850
He's in a hurry to get it done!

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:17.060
So that I don't lose out to Mocchi,

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:19.810
I think I need to push things forward.

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.980
Hm...

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:24.230
But is there any point to
what you were just doing?

00:01:24.230 --> 00:01:25.270
Of course!

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:28.860
It says in here you should have a
stand-in help you practice!

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:34.070
This looks so sketchy...

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:34.660
Huh?!

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:37.330
You're being way too blunt!

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:38.040
Tsuyopon, you're mean!

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:39.410
<i>Things feel the same as ever.</i>

00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:40.460
<i>Things feel the same as ever.</i>

00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:42.420
<i>It's soothing.</i>

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:16.340
So, what do you think will work best?

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:17.640
Huh?

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:19.100
For the confession.

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:22.100
I want it to be cool,
like something out of a drama.

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:23.140
Any ideas?

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:25.810
Oh, we're still talking about that?

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:27.480
Setting up the situation?

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:28.060
Right.

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:29.730
If it were me...

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:32.980
I think being alone together in a room
at the karaoke place might be good.

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:34.490
Like...

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:41.870
You're a good singer.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:45.750
Thanks.

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:49.000
Huh?

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:52.170
You're still sitting over on that side?

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:53.500
Come over here.

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.390
A little closer.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:04.220
Right here.

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:05.980
You're so close.

00:04:05.980 --> 00:04:06.730
You don't like it?

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:09.650
I don't dislike it, but...

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:12.270
I love you,

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:13.070
so I want us to be close.

00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:15.150
Can't we?

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:16.860
Okay.

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:21.820
Hey, hold it!

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:24.870
Don't use Kobayakawa-san for this!

00:04:24.870 --> 00:04:27.250
I thought that'd make it easier
for you to understand!

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:31.170
By the way, we kiss right after that.

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:32.460
Ki—!

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:33.590
Isn't that fast?

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:34.800
Not for me.

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.630
I want it, so I go for it.

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:38.800
Mattsun's supposedly an indiscriminate kisser.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:42.300
He was expounding at length about
the greatness of kissing just recently.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:43.140
It creeped me out.

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:45.390
Ew, what a perv!

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:47.770
You're the last guy I want to hear that from!

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:49.270
Huh?

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:51.650
But I tend to start these things normally.

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:53.270
Like how?

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:54.940
If I had to choose,

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:57.570
I'd rather make them confess than confess myself.

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:02.070
I've been waiting.

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:05.200
I'm sorry. I had a committee meeting.

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:07.290
Oh, it's fine, it's fine.

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:08.450
What did you need?

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:09.580
Hm...

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:11.670
It's not that I need something from you,

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:15.590
but I thought you might need me.

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:17.090
Huh?

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:19.130
I don't, actually...

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:20.840
Don't lie.

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:22.050
I'm not.

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:28.640
Um...

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:30.560
I'm... leaving.

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:37.480
Say it.

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:42.780
I...

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:44.070
I love you.

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:51.290
Well done.

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:55.920
Well? Pretty normal, right?

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:58.250
And, to make it a more
useful reference for Na-chan,

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:00.550
It didn't involve any props.

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:04.590
Not Kobayakawa-san...

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:05.720
That's twice now!

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:07.680
Why are you crying?

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:09.640
We were just giving examples.

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:11.980
Don't make examples with her!

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:15.980
And you're both so hyper-confident.
I can't use them as references!

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:18.070
Ugh, fine. Sorry, all right?

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:19.730
And they made me so jealous!

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.570
Then they were useful references!

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:22.650
Yes!

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:23.400
Is that wrong?!

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:23.740
Well, it's not, but...

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:25.240
<i>Those were both pretty contrived...</i>

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:25.990
<i>Those were both pretty contrived...</i>

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:27.910
How about you, Tsuyopon?

00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:30.620
You could use Yukirin as your co-actor.

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:32.200
Hey, that's right!

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:33.870
What'd you say to get her to go out with you?

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:34.830
No...

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:38.590
I don't think my experience would be
a useful reference for Na-chan, either.

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:39.800
Yes it would!

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:41.010
It's from actual experience, right?

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:42.550
That's what I need most!

00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:43.510
Sounds like fun!

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.800
Were you nervous?

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:46.680
Did you stutter?

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:48.050
That sounds more like you, Na-chan.

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:48.760
No...

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:49.930
In my case...

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:52.390
...it was Yukirin who confessed.

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:57.650
What? That's boring!

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:59.570
Wait, what do you mean, boring?

00:06:59.570 --> 00:07:01.780
But it makes sense if you think about it.

00:07:01.780 --> 00:07:04.200
Yukirin does seem pretty forward.

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:08.660
I've always assumed it was you
who confessed, though.

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:09.370
Assumed?

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:12.870
I thought you were the type who
could speak up when you had to.

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:17.630
Huh? But doesn't he seem a bit
"M" when around Yukirin?

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:20.540
No, you're wrong.

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:23.380
He definitely lets out his masculine
side when around Yukirin.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:24.470
A closet pervert.

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:27.390
Well? Am I right?

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:28.720
No comment.

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:29.850
Why?!

00:07:29.850 --> 00:07:31.310
Tell us!

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:33.140
Cheapskate!

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:42.570
Tsuyoponnu, who knew you were "M"!

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:45.780
Boys have some fun conversations.

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:48.320
I wish I could have joined in.

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:50.120
It wasn't fun for me.

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:53.490
The subject strayed even further from
helping Na-chan with his confession.

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:57.120
Until it was time to leave, they were
thinking up lines I'd probably say.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:58.250
And at the end,

00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:02.170
they joked that we end our sentences
with "Nyan" when we're alone.

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:04.420
Oh, the kitty talk is something I'd do.

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:07.170
They just don't get it.

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:10.260
Your love isn't something
that comes through in words.

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:13.350
Maybe it's something only I can see!

00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:16.770
Though, would you try saying
"I love you" occasionally?

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:19.190
I'll pass.

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:22.020
You're such a shy guy.

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:22.650
Not really...

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.070
Oh, right!

00:08:24.860 --> 00:08:28.490
I found that new volume you were looking for.

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:30.240
Ta-dah!

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:31.660
Thanks.

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:33.830
Yukirin, are you a goddess?

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:37.160
You're only open about
your feelings at times like this.

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:40.500
That's not true at all Yukirin-sama.

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:42.460
Well then, here's an order
from your Yukirin-sama!

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:44.840
Say "Nyaa" for me!

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:50.430
Nyaa.

00:08:50.430 --> 00:08:52.850
You didn't put any heart into it at all!

00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:55.350
But it was still adorable, Tsuyoponnu!

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:58.350
You always seem like you're having fun.

00:08:58.350 --> 00:08:59.730
I am!

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:01.020
Oh, but you know...

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:03.110
When I'm with you, Tsuyoponnu,

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:04.940
everything is fun!

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:08.990
Unlike me, Yukirin really
is open about her feelings.

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:11.490
I'm impressed how you can
just say things like that.

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:12.490
Hm...

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:14.200
I find myself wanting to say them.

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:15.410
My mouth does the rest!

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:17.200
I see...

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:19.250
<i>She's bright, cheerful, and innocent...</i>

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:21.710
<i>She understands the things I can't say...</i>

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:25.130
I think...

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:29.050
That's what I love about you.

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:30.970
Hey...

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:33.800
Can't you look my way?

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:36.100
I don't wanna.

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:39.810
Tsuyoponnu, you're so cute!

00:09:40.770 --> 00:09:44.690
<i>Did I suddenly want to say
something I normally wouldn't...</i>

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:48.230
<i>because of today's conversation?</i>

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:51.530
<i>Or was it just a whim?</i>

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:56.780
<i>I'm not really sure...</i>

00:09:57.740 --> 00:10:00.080
<i>...but this isn't so bad once in a while.</i>

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:09.880
Well, what you guys were saying
wasn't totally off base.

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:11.510
That frustrates me a bit.

00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:13.180
Huh? What's this about?

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:14.970
Nothing, just talking to myself.

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:18.100
Oh, right, Na-chan.

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:19.850
Yukirin lent me this.

00:10:19.850 --> 00:10:20.810
What's that?

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:23.190
Bessatsu Margaret.

00:10:23.190 --> 00:10:25.190
"It's a young girl's bible," she said.

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:28.360
Why am I being given a bible for young girls?

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:31.110
"If you're going to confess,
this is just the thing, Nyan," she said.

00:10:31.490 --> 00:10:33.070
Oh, I see!

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:33.820
Thank—

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:34.990
Wait, how did she know?!

00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:36.450
She said it was obvious.

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:37.580
Plus I told her.

00:10:37.580 --> 00:10:38.490
Hey!

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:40.200
We're in another room next period!

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:42.710
Oh, look, Na-chan.

00:10:42.710 --> 00:10:44.040
Kobayakawa-san is over there.

00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:47.920
Are they in art class, you think?

00:10:47.920 --> 00:10:50.380
She really is clinging to her tightly.

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:53.550
I hear she's tightened her guard now.

00:10:53.550 --> 00:10:55.590
Huh?! Where'd you get that info?

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:56.550
Mocchi.

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:59.680
He said he was having trouble
because it's hard to approach them.

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:01.430
Which means... me, too...

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:03.600
She calls me a little monkey, after all.

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:06.020
Oh, Spitting Woman noticed us.

00:11:08.360 --> 00:11:10.520
Her eyes tell what she wants to say.

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:12.320
I can't call out to them.

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:14.820
Those two sure are close.

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:16.740
I wonder why.

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:18.490
I want to get along with her,

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:20.620
but she seems to hate me.

00:11:20.620 --> 00:11:24.120
I'm starting to think I'll need
Tsutsui-san's blessing before I confess.

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:29.210
She has such a happy smile on her face.
